{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/greenhouse-gas-reporting-conversion-factors-2026","content_id":"4c681f9f-729a-4c8e-9f4c-d36d2d95fb92","description":"These conversion factors enable users to calculate and report greenhouse gas emissions from their UK activities in 2026.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alt.formats@energysecurity.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a29392bade52dc0882218a8","filename":"ghg-conversion-factors-2026-full-set.xlsx"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet","file_size":2109334,"filename":"ghg-conversion-factors-2026-full-set.xlsx","id":"9429236","isbn":"","title":"Conversion factors 2026: full set (for all users)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a29392bade52dc0882218a8/ghg-conversion-factors-2026-full-set.xlsx"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alt.formats@energysecurity.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a6c9748862aaf18d9c62ac9","filename":"ghg-conversion-factors-2026-flat-format-revised.xlsx"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet","file_size":515426,"filename":"ghg-conversion-factors-2026-flat-format-revised.xlsx","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9429245","isbn":"","title":"Conversion factors 2026: flat file (for automatic processing only) - updated July 2026","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6c9748862aaf18d9c62ac9/ghg-conversion-factors-2026-flat-format-revised.xlsx"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alt.formats@energysecurity.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a2940543b15d05a7ce3202e","filename":"2026-GHG-conversion-factors-methodology-report.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":1761487,"filename":"2026-GHG-conversion-factors-methodology-report.pdf","id":"9429238","isbn":"","number_of_pages":152,"title":"Conversion factors 2026: methodology","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a2940543b15d05a7ce3202e/2026-GHG-conversion-factors-methodology-report.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alt.formats@energysecurity.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a2940653b15d05a7ce3202f","filename":"2026-GHG-conversion-factors-major-changes-report.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":270986,"filename":"2026-GHG-conversion-factors-major-changes-report.pdf","id":"9429239","isbn":"","number_of_pages":18,"title":"Conversion factors 2026: major changes","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a2940653b15d05a7ce3202f/2026-GHG-conversion-factors-major-changes-report.pdf"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9429240","isbn":"","title":"Conversion factors 2026: statement of voluntary compliance with the Code of Practice for Statistics","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/greenhouse-gas-reporting-conversion-factors-2026/conversion-factors-2026-statement-of-voluntary-compliance-with-the-code-of-practice-for-statistics"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <h3 id=\"update-july-2026\">Update: July 2026</h3>\n\n  <p>Due to a minor error, we have republished the conversion factors 2026: flat file (for automatic processing only). This corrects a number of values that were incorrectly reported as 0 rather than left blank where no data were available. The affected factors relate to well-to-tank emissions from certain hybrid, CNG and LPG cars, and hotel stays in certain countries.</p>\n\n  <p>These values were correctly left blank in the Conversion Factors 2026: full set published in June, which has not been revised.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>The UK government conversion factors for company reporting of greenhouse gas emissions enable users to calculate and report their emissions based on their activity data, such as volume of fuel used, <abbr title=\"kilowatt hour\">kWh</abbr> of electricity purchased, or distance travelled, for their Scope 1, 2 and 3 emissions separately.</p>\n\n<p>They are suitable for use by:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>UK-based organisations of all sizes</li>\n  <li>International organisations reporting on their UK operations</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>They are relevant to <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/environmental-reporting-guidelines-including-mandatory-greenhouse-gas-emissions-reporting-guidance\">Environmental Reporting Guidelines, including Streamlined Energy and Carbon Reporting (<abbr title=\"Streamlined Energy and Carbon Reporting\">SECR</abbr>) regulations</a>. The factors may also be used for other purposes, but users do so at their own risk.</p>\n\n<p>An update is published each year, together with a methodology report explaining how they are derived and a major changes report explaining any major changes since the previous publication.</p>\n\n<p>These conversion factors differ from the spend-based emissions multipliers currently published by the Department for Environment, Food &amp; Rural Affairs (<abbr title=\"Department for Environment, Food &amp; Rural Affairs\">Defra</abbr>) alongside the annual <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/statistics/uks-carbon-footprint\">UK and England carbon footprint</a> publication. <abbr title=\"Department for Environment, Food &amp; Rural Affairs\">Defra</abbr>’s spend-based multipliers are primarily intended to allow users to compare the carbon intensities of different categories of final UK demand, however, they can be used to provide an initial assessment of a user’s full supply-chain emissions based on spending across different goods and services.</p>\n\n<p>Users may wish to use spend-based methods where they do not have sufficient data to use activity-based methods. Users should ensure they report the methods used for their emissions accounting.</p>\n\n<p><strong>New users</strong> should read the general guidance and FAQs provided in the ‘Introduction’ worksheet as well as the specific guidance and FAQs provided in each relevant worksheet in the ‘full set’ spreadsheet.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Regular users</strong> should read the ‘What’s new’ worksheet in the ‘full set’ spreadsheet which highlights significant changes to support consistent and comparable reporting year-on-year.</p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Updated the conversion factors 2026: flat file to correct a number of values that were initially reported as 0.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-31T12:51:53Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-11T08:30:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Research","emphasised_organisations":["6315817c-ef11-4905-bb4d-b6dca8e9052c"],"featured_attachments":["9429236","9429245","9429238","9429239","9429240"],"first_public_at":"2026-06-11T09:30:00.000+01:00","political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"research","first_published_at":"2026-06-11T09:30:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/greenhouse-gas-reporting-conversion-factors-2026","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/greenhouse-gas-reporting-conversion-factors-2026","base_path":"/government/publications/greenhouse-gas-reporting-conversion-factors-2026","content_id":"4c681f9f-729a-4c8e-9f4c-d36d2d95fb92","document_type":"research","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"202